				<description>&lt;p&gt;In this topic we will cover the &lt;a href=&#34;https://leetcode.com/problems/find-all-anagrams-in-a-string/&#34;&gt;&lt;em&gt;leetcode #438&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt; Find all anagram programming question.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;problem-statement&#34;&gt;Problem Statement:&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Given two strings s and p, return *an array of all the start indices of p&amp;rsquo;s anagrams in *s. You may return the answer in &lt;strong&gt;any order&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;input&#34;&gt;Input&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;String from&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;   &amp;ndash; this is the main string from which we have to find all the anagrams.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;String find&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;    &amp;ndash; this is the string for which we have to find if its anagrams are present in the &lt;em&gt;from&lt;/em&gt; string.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
